# Sensitive paths: one glob per line. `**` matches any number of folders.
# Two classes, set by the `# class:` lines (a glob before any of them is owner-ok;
# a path in both is owner-ok):
# - owner-ok: the `policy` job of CI puts `needs-owner-ok` on the PR and
#   close-phase.sh --merge refuses without the repo owner's ok.
# - gate: the PR gets `needs-gate-review` and close-phase.sh --merge asks for a
#   second close-reviewer opinion ("does it weaken the gate?"), not for the owner.
# class: owner-ok
**/auth/**
**/billing/**
**/payments/**
db/migrations/**
**/migrations/**
.env*
**/.env*
**/secrets/**
**/credentials/**
infra/production/**
# class: gate
# Dependencies and lockfiles
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
**/yarn.lock
poetry.lock
uv.lock
requirements*.txt
Gemfile.lock
go.sum
Cargo.lock
